# Debt Collection Platform — files that must never enter history.
# The repository root already ignores node_modules, dist, bin, obj, .turbo and .env files;
# this file adds what is specific to DCP.

# Strong-name key. The assembly identity depends on it
# (Qdb.DebtCollection.Plugins, PublicKeyToken=f70ee8facd683d55), so it is signing material:
# losing it means a new identity that can never re-register over the organisation's assembly,
# and committing it hands that identity to anyone who can read the repository.
# It is backed up out of band — see KnownIssues KI-13.
key.snk
*.snk
*.pfx

# Base64 assembly dumps produced while inspecting a registered plugin assembly.
*.b64

# Provisioning and smoke run logs.
*.log
